## Implementation (commits 1ef30a9, b0e817a)
1. command_palette.rs: dispatch mount titles (Select model/agent/
   variant; Sessions/MCP servers unchanged); model_list_props
   connected-gated (flat rows, no categories/descriptions, action
   row View all integrations|Connect an integration ctrl+a);
   suggested(provider.connect) = !ServerLists.connected.
2. store.rs: ServerLists.connected + set_integration_connected;
   focus_dialog_current SKIPS ServerList{model.list} (cursor row 0);
   TabsState.hover_close + set_tab_hover(_, close).
3. app.rs: spawn_server_lists folds integration.list → Connected
   event; strip mouse routing via strip_layout_tabs/strip_hover_at
   (home appends pseudo-tab NEW_SESSION_TAB_ID, showPlus=false);
   last_pointer + refresh_strip_hover after mouse-driven strip
   mutations (opentui re-hover semantics); pseudo ✕ → select last
   tab (close(undefined)); Tab(pseudo) = stay home.
4. session.rs paint_live_tabs_bar: home pseudo-tab + close_hover
   passthrough. session_tabs_solid.rs: fade_title_color (verbatim
   FADE_WIDTH=4 tail fade), close_chunks close-hover → text.base,
   indicator "+" for the pseudo (tint(text,selected,0.25), bold).
5. Tests: models_panel_golden.rs (open/selected/marker/connected),
   pty_models_panel.rs (open→select→apply cycle), app home-strip +
   add-release hover persistence, strip fade/close-hover/pseudo
   unit tests, palette trio + agent/variant titles + cursor-0.
   oc-tui full: 690/691 pass (1 pre-existing skip). clippy clean.
NOTE (gap): model.dialog.provider ctrl+a is RENDERED but not
   dispatched (v2 replaces with DialogIntegration — separate
   surface, not in the census cells; no rig script triggers it).

